        <ul>
          <li><a href="/changelog/">Changelog, 3.2.0 through 6.4.0</a></li>
          <li><a href="/docs/install/">Install, pinned to 6.4.0</a></li>
          <li><a href="/docs/clients/">Client matrix for 6.4.0</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog/rea-agents-6-4-0/">6.4.0 operator guide (ADB, JEB, compact schema)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/docs/jeb/">JEB, bring your own license</a></li>
          <li><a href="/docs/android-adb/">Android ADB device lane</a></li>
        </ul>

        <footer class="mt-12 border-t border-[var(--color-line)] pt-6 text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)] not-prose">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Sources</p>
          <ol class="mt-3 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5 text-xs">
            <li><a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/blob/rea-agents-6.4.0/docs/migration-6.2.md" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">docs/migration-6.2.md at rea-agents-6.4.0</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/releases/tag/rea-agents-6.0.0" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">6.0.0</a> · <a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/releases/tag/rea-agents-6.1.0" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">6.1.0</a> · <a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/releases/tag/rea-agents-6.2.0" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">6.2.0</a> · <a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/releases/tag/rea-agents-6.3.0" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">6.3.0</a> · <a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/releases/tag/rea-agents-6.4.0" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">6.4.0</a></li>
            <li>npm <code>rea-agents</code> latest checked 2026-10-13: 6.4.0</li>
          </ol>
          <p class="mt-4"><a class="quiet-link" href="/compliance/">Compliance</a></p>
        </footer>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
